{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261109/photo/bkn-20261109083212055-1109_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261109085349\"/><p>何文田站有列車設備故障。</p><p>今日(9日)早上8時34分，港鐵宣布，由於何文田站有列車設備故障，現時觀塘綫來往黃埔站及調景嶺站的整體行車時間預計需要額外10至15分鐘。請乘客為行程預留充裕時間。</p><p>至早上8時52分，故障的列車已駛離行車綫，觀塘綫列車服務陸續恢復正常。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.643308+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T00:32:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:57:00.918924+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:45.124801+00:00","content_hash":"c27615726d5b4838b0588e83ce24e0b4774cd984674994156e68b797178cf706","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.643308+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}